llm_response:
The login/logout control is contained within the `userlinks` block of the browsable API base template. When you override a block in your custom `api.html` template, you replace the default content of that block.

To ensure the login/logout links survive while adding your own customizations, you must use `{{ block.super }}` within the `userlinks` block. This preserves the existing authentication links instead of replacing them.

Example of how to preserve the links:

```html
{% block userlinks %}
    {{ block.super }}
    <!-- Add your additional links here -->
{% endblock %}
```

